SUMMARY:Squash the Block
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Halloween in the heart of Nashville during the annual Squash the Block community trick-or-treat event! Families, kids, and visitors are invited to dress in costume and explore downtown Nashville while collecting candy and treats from participating local businesses.\nThis festive evening features safe, family-friendly fun throughout town, including themed activities, costumed volunteers, and stops along the Salt Creek Trail. From candy stations and photo opportunities to community events like the Alleyween Party, Squash the Block brings the entire Brown County community together for a fun-filled Halloween tradition.\nGrab your costume, bring your candy bag, and enjoy an unforgettable evening of treats, music, games, and hometown Halloween spirit in beautiful Brown County!\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/squash-the-block/
ORGANIZER;CN=Brown County Convention &amp; Visitors Bureau:MAILTO:cvillani@browncounty.com
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Family Friendly,Food &amp; Drink,Free,Happening,Holiday,Outdoor Adventure
LOCATION:Nashville, IN
