SUMMARY:Prime Rib Thursdays
DESCRIPTION:Thursday nights just got a whole lot tastier.\nJoin us every Thursday from 5–8 PM for Prime Rib Night. We’re serving up juicy, slow-roasted 12 oz cuts of prime rib, paired with your choice of potato and chef’s vegetable or a fresh house salad.\nWant to level it up? Upgrade your sides or add a serving of our creamy Cavatappi mac & cheese.\nIt’s the perfect way to kick off your weekend early—with flavor, comfort, and a plate worth bragging about.\nFerguson House Bistro\nEvery Thursday | 5–8 PM\n78 Franklin St, Nashville, IN\n
