SUMMARY:Pottery Wheel Experience
DESCRIPTION:Ever wanted to try your hand at pottery? Give it a spin…Come and try! We’ll show you the basics of how to throw on the wheel. You’ll make a small bowl or cup and choose a glaze. Firing and finishing your piece takes some time, so your piece will be shipped to you after your visit. Bring a friend. Spots limited to 6 per time slot. Cost of this workshop includes instruction, glaze, firing and shipping. Ages 10+.\n
