SUMMARY:Dinner & Fine Art, Antiques, Collectibles and Jewelry Auction
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an evening of delicious food, beautiful artwork, and unique finds at St. David’s Episcopal Church in Bean Blossom, Indiana!\nJoin St. David’s for a homemade spaghetti dinner and silent auction featuring an exciting collection of fine art, antiques, collectibles, and jewelry. Browse original oil and watercolor paintings, signed prints, photography, designer floral arrangements, handmade canes, fine antiques, and more. It’s a wonderful opportunity to discover one-of-a-kind treasures and get a head start on holiday shopping!\nDinner is $15 per person and includes homemade spaghetti, salad, a beverage, and dessert.\nBest of all, proceeds benefit nonprofit organizations locally and around the world.\nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday, November 21, 2026\nTime: 5:00–7:10 PM\nLocation: St. David’s Episcopal Church, Bean Blossom, Indiana (intersection of State Roads 135 and 45)\nDinner: $15 per person\nReservations: Requested but not required\n\nEvening Schedule\n\n5:00 PM: Doors open; silent auction browsing and bidding begin\n5:45 PM: Spaghetti dinner\n6:15 PM: Auction browsing and bidding continue\n6:30 PM: Dessert\n6:50 PM: Final opportunity to browse and place bids\n7:10 PM: Bidding closes, followed by checkout\n\nSome auction items may have reserve prices.\nFor more information or reservations:\nEmail: info@stdavidsbb.org ( mailto:info@stdavidsbb.org )\nPhone: 812-988-1038\nCome enjoy an evening of food, fellowship, and holiday shopping while supporting meaningful causes!\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/dinner-fine-art-antiques-collectibles-and-jewelry-auction/
CATEGORIES:Art Events &amp; Exhibits,Food &amp; Drink,Special Events
LOCATION:11 IN-45, Morgantown, IN 46160
