SUMMARY:Hog Wild Christmas Bazaar
DESCRIPTION:Hog Wild Christmas Bazaar\nGet into the holiday spirit at the Hog Wild Christmas Bazaar in Brown County, Indiana!\nJoin us at the Brown County 4-H Fairgrounds for a festive day of holiday shopping, delicious food, and seasonal fun. Browse 60+ vendors offering a wide variety of products, unique finds, and gifts for everyone on your Christmas list.\nTake a break from shopping and grab a bite from the food and drink trucks on-site. Whether you’re searching for the perfect holiday gift or simply looking to enjoy a festive outing, the Hog Wild Christmas Bazaar is a great way to kick off the holiday season while supporting local and regional vendors!\nEvent Details:\n\nDate: Saturday, December 5, 2026\nTime: 9:00 AM – 3:00 PM\nLocation: Brown County 4-H Fairgrounds, Nashville, Indiana\nFeaturing: 60+ vendors, holiday shopping, and food and drink trucks\n\nBring your friends and family for a day of Christmas shopping in Brown County!\n
