SUMMARY:The Fab Four
DESCRIPTION:If you want to experience the best Beatles tribute ever, you won’t want to miss The Fab Four: The Ultimate Tribute, live at the Brown County Music Center in Nashville, Ind., on Friday, February 19, 2027.\nThe Emmy Award Winning Fab Four is elevated far above every other Beatles Tribute due to their precise attention to detail. With uncanny, note-for-note live renditions of Beatles’ classics such as “Can’t Buy Me Love,” “Yesterday,” “A Day In The Life,” “Twist And Shout,” “Here Comes The Sun,” and “Hey Jude”, the Fab Four will make you think you are watching the real thing. Their incredible stage performances include three costume changes representing every era of the Beatles ever-changing career. This loving tribute to the Beatles has amazed audiences in countries around the world, including Japan, Australia, France, Hong Kong, The United Kingdom, Germany, Mexico and Brazil.\n
