SUMMARY:The Price Is Right LIVE
DESCRIPTION:It’s not TV… It’s LIVE. Feel the excitement as America’s favorite game show unfolds right in front of you; fans get the chance to step into the action and experience the games they know and love in person.\nHosted by our energetic Celebrity Host, randomly selected contestants from the audience can play iconic games like Plinko™, Secret X™, Cliffhangers™, The Big Wheel™, and the fabulous Showcase™. With incredible prizes including cash, electronics, home appliances, dream vacations, and even a brand-new car, every show is packed with surprises. Plus, lucky audience members can win prizes right from their seats!\nWhether you’ve watched for decades or you’re introducing a new generation to the excitement, THE PRICE IS RIGHT LIVE™ is the perfect outing for families, friends, date nights, birthdays, reunions, and group celebrations. Every performance is filled with laughter, cheering, friendly competition, and unforgettable moments.\nThink you’re the ultimate fan? Ever dreamed of hearing your name called and spinning The Big Wheel™? Make your experience even more memorable with our exclusive VIP packages, including Spin The Big Wheel™ and Meet & Greet photo opportunities. Visit our website for package details.\nFor more than 20 years, THE PRICE IS RIGHT LIVE™ has entertained packed audiences across North America while awarding more than $15 million in cash and prizes. Every show is different, every audience is part of the action, and the next contestant could be YOU!\nFor generations, millions of fans have dreamed of hearing three unforgettable words…\nCome On Down… You Could Be Next!\nhttp://priceisrightlive.com/\n
