SUMMARY:Tusk: The Classic Fleetwood Mac Tribute
DESCRIPTION:Playing the hits and deep cuts spanning the careers of Rock & Roll Hall of Fame inductees Fleetwood Mac, TUSK: The Classic Fleetwood Mac Tribute returns to the Brown County Music Center in Nashville, Ind., on Friday, November 20, 2026.\nTUSK has been crisscrossing the country since 2008 as The Classic Fleetwood Mac Tribute. Five pro musicians turned into masters of their trade through decades of individual music study, live performance, creative risk, and devotion to the art. TUSK features note-perfect renditions of both the solo and full band songs, with each member specializing in one of the core lineup of Fleetwood Mac (Lindsey Buckingham, Stevie Nicks, Christine McVie, John McVie, and Mick Fleetwood). They possess an electric stage presence that can only come from well over a decade touring together. While exceptional musicianship, authentic vocals, and meticulous attention to detail are essential, what truly sets TUSK apart can’t be learned or manufactured.\nTruly the best at what they do, TUSK is unmatched in their tribute to one of the greatest bands of all time.\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/tusk-the-classic-fleetwood-mac-tribute/
