SUMMARY:Silly Goose Beginner Crochet Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Crochet is simple you silly goose! Learn very simple basics like a magic circle, single crochet, double crochet and more to create an adorable hat and scarf for this desk goose. Choose from an assortment of yarn colors and little signs to make your goose a fall goose or a holiday goose. This makes a great gift for someone on your shopping list.\nJoin us for our Friday Workshops! Workshops run from Friday, September 25 to December 11, 6PM to 8PM. Make sure to select your workshop date and the 6:00 timeslot to be signed up. Your project price includes one beverage; wine, beer, coffee, espresso, hot chocolate or tea (other selections are available) Ages 15+\nSeats limited. You must book ahead. Please note that our workshops are non-refundable due to limited seating.\nYou must be 21+ to consume alcohol.\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/silly-goose-beginner-crochet-workshop/
