SUMMARY:Songwriter Showdown
DESCRIPTION:Songwriter Showdown returns to Nashville, Indiana, for a multi-week live music competition featuring talented songwriters from across the region. Held in Brown County, this exciting series highlights original music, storytelling, and crowd-favorite performances as artists compete for top honors. Experience the creativity and rising talent that make Nashville, Indiana a hub for live music.\n
